  "about_item": [
    "Natural Flea & Tick Support for Dogs - A balanced blend of natural essentials that help support skin, coat, and immune health—creating a less attractive environment for fleas and ticks and discouraging them from laying eggs on your dog’s coat, while keeping your pet in a happy and comfortable state and helping provide longer-lasting protection from fleas and ticks.",
    "Daily Defense + Skin & Coat Care - This flea & tick prevention supplement is made with pure, natural ingredients that are safe and effective. Formulated with flaxseed, neem, and rosemary to create an unfavorable environment for fleas and ticks when used daily. These chews also provide additional nutritional support with a Vitamin B blend, probiotics blend, and Omega-3 for healthier skin and a shinier coat.",
    "Comprehensive Support for dogs - Provides comprehensive support with a chewable flea and tick supplement that helps boost daily immunity against seasonal pests. These chews help discourage fleas and ticks while also supporting healthy skin. Formulated to strengthen the body’s natural defenses from within, offering dogs added support in various outdoor environments.",
    "No harsh chemicals added. Crafted with clean, science-backed ingredients as a natural alternative to synthetic chemical treatments, this gentle daily supplement is safe for all breeds and life stages. Ideal for long-term use, it provides a worry-free way to maintain a healthy, shiny coat.",
    "Delicious Chicken-Flavored Chews - Made with a tasty chicken flavor that dogs can’t resist, these chews are a flavorful alternative to pills or tablets. Even picky eaters will happily enjoy them, making it easy to provide daily support. Your Puppies will look forward to each bite as a snack-like treat while getting the benefits they need.",
    "Buy with Confidence - If you or your pet aren’t completely satisfied with the results, we’ve got you covered. If you have any issues with the product, simply contact us via Amazon Message Center. You’ll Enjoy a full refund, no questions asked!"
  ],
