      {
        "position": 1,
        "title": "High Palatability",
        "text": "This external protection chewable tablet features a rich chicken flavor with lovely heart‑shaped pellets. My dog has no resistance to it at all and comes forward actively every feeding time, so there is no need for forced administration or mixing it into food to coax eating, making daily feeding extremely convenient. It helps defend against fleas, ticks and mosquitoes and lowers the risk of my pet being bitten by external parasites, so I feel much more at ease when walking the dog through grasslands and woodland areas now. Moreover, the product adopts a natural non‑GMO formula without harsh chemical ingredients for safer feeding. Besides parasite prevention and protection, it also supports skin and coat care as well as immune regulation, delivering the dual benefits of protection and nourishment.",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "August 5, 2026",
        "author": "Hudson",
        "author_link": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AE5WLOHTUCYSSU27GDFUPQOQF3AQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top",
        "author_image": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png",
        "helpful_votes": "One person found this helpful"
      },
      {
        "position": 2,
        "title": "Easy to Give and My Parents' Dog Likes It",
        "text": "I ordered these flea and tick prevention chews for my parents' dog because he can be picky with tablets. These chews are much easier since they look like treats, and he takes them without any struggle. The size is just right, and they don't leave a strong smell on your hands. The container closes tightly, which helps keep everything fresh and easy to store. I also like that the ingredients are clearly listed on the label. My parents appreciate anything that makes caring for their dog a little simpler. It fits nicely into his daily routine without adding extra work. The package is lightweight but holds plenty of chews. It's a convenient option to keep in the kitchen cabinet, and there is no need to hide it inside other food. This has been an easy addition to his regular care.",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "July 31, 2026",
        "author": "amazon customer",
        "author_link": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGFJNHPTRFJ7TUJU3VDXPODHU3IA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top",
        "author_image": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png",
        "helpful_votes": "One person found this helpful"
      },
      {
        "position": 3,
        "title": "Good Natural Chews for My Dog",
        "text": "I gave these chews to my dog in order to improve his daily wellness routine, and he takes them quite willingly thanks to the chicken flavor. The formula is free from harsh chemicals, which makes it feel suitable for long term use. The 150 count bottle gives me a really good supply and is of a great value. The chews are soft and easy to break apart for smaller breeds of dogs if necessary. My dog’s coat looks much better after over a week of steady use. They’re convenient to keep on hand and don’t create any mess. For everyday dog support, these chews are the perfect fit for my dog.",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "July 30, 2026",
        "author": "NYCstyle",
        "author_link": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGYFXWNUFGEQQVUN3GLBS5Y2JP6Q?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top",
        "author_image": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png"
      },
      {
        "position": 4,
        "title": "Easy Daily Chews for Dogs of Different Sizes",
        "text": "These chewable supplements are easy to add to my dogs’ daily routine. The texture is soft enough to break into smaller pieces when needed, and my dogs accept them like regular treats without any hesitation.The 150-count container provides a generous supply, especially for a household with more than one dog. I also appreciate that the serving directions are organized by weight, making it easier to determine the appropriate amount for different breeds and sizes.The container seals securely, and the chews have remained fresh without becoming overly dry or crumbly. They are a convenient option for owners looking to add flea and tick support to their dogs’ regular care routine. I still use them as part of a broader prevention plan rather than relying on a supplement alone.",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "July 25, 2026",
        "author": "Big Sea",
        "author_link": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHB6HUPOQXFBTZSNR6AFXUFAOUIQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top",
        "author_image": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/67adef94-531f-475d-af46-496474791b0f._CR0%2C0%2C500%2C500_SX460_SX48_.jpeg",
        "helpful_votes": "One person found this helpful"
