      {
        "position": 5,
        "title": "This is super helpful for my dog when we are traveling",
        "text": "Carrying a bottle of chews felt easier than packing liquid supplements or products that could leak inside my luggage.I placed the amount needed for each trip into a small sealed container and gave them with his breakfast. He ate them without needing any extra food, and the soft texture made them easy to handle.They are convenient for travel and everyday use, especially with so many pieces in the full container. I would not treat a supplement as a substitute for veterinary flea-and-tick medication, but these fit easily into the broader care routine I follow for my dog.",
        "rating": 5,
