      {
        "position": 6,
        "title": "Easy Treats for My Dog’s Routine",
        "text": "I like that these flea and tick chews are simple to add into my dog's daily routine. My dog thinks they are treats, so giving them is a lot easier than trying to deal with messy applications or sprays. The texture and size are convenient, and the container has plenty to last a while.The packaging is nice, and it’s easy to keep track of the daily routine. It ain't some complicated product, just a simple supplement option that fits right into taking care of my furry buddy.",
        "rating": 5,
